4" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Joseph Conrad</span><span class="tp">1857–1924</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/rajendra-prasad"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/rajendra-prasad.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Rajendra Prasad</span><span class="tp">1884–1963</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/abimael-guzman"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/abimael-guzman.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Abimael Guzmán</span><span class="tp">1934–2021</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 3 December <span class="n">6</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/henry-iii-the-white"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/henry-iii-the-white.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Henry III the White</span><span class="tp">c. 1227–1266</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/vasily-iii-of-moscow"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/vasily-iii-of-moscow.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Vasily III of Moscow</span><span class="tp">1479–1533</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/francis-xavier"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/francis-xavier.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Francis Xavier</span><span class="tp">1506–1552</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/alessandro-farnese-duke-of-parma"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/alessandro-farnese-duke-of-parma.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Alessandro Farnese, Duke of Parma</span><span class="tp">1545–1592</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/honda-tadakatsu"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/honda-tadakatsu.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Honda Tadakatsu</span><span class="tp">1548–1610</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/robert-louis-stevenson"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/robert-louis-stevenson.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Robert Louis Stevenson</span><span class="tp">1850–1894</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
